        "pkcontributionId": 69146,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 311,
        "headingId": 539,
        "headingText": "<p><em>ALK</em>-rearranged renal cell carcinomas (RCCs) harbour chromosome translocations resulting in gene fusions involving the anaplastic lymphoma kinase gene (<em>ALK</em>) at chromosome 2p23.</p>",
